# IAP offer popups (named)

All of these use **`IapOfferPopup`** (`components/IapOfferPopup.tsx`) — premium top band + header ring (not the post-purchase **`PurchaseSuccessfulPopup`**, which stays plain cream). **Starter Pack popup** and **Field Pack popup** use purple band / `assets/ui/popup_header_purple.png`. **Remove Ads popup** uses red band (`#eb5761` fill, `#d33d57` wide stroke), `assets/ui/popup_header_red.png`, title `#af233a`, and a vertical shell nudge in `App.tsx`.

| Name (when talking to the AI) | `offerId` constant | `offers.ts` row |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Starter Pack popup** | `STORE_IAP_OFFER_STARTER_PACK_ID` | `STORE_BUNDLE_OFFERS` starter bundle (garden 1 level 4) |
| **Field Pack popup** | `STORE_IAP_OFFER_FIELD_PACK_ID` | `STORE_BUNDLE_OFFERS` field bundle (garden 2+ level 4; own rewards/timer keys) |
| **Remove Ads popup** | `STORE_IAP_OFFER_REMOVE_ADS_ID` | `STORE_COIN_OFFERS` Remove Ads (7d, same price/icon as store small row) |

- **State:** `iapOfferUi` in `App.tsx` — `setIapOfferUi({ offerId: … })`.
- **Farm:** Starter / Field Pack floating button → matching popup; NO ADS floating button → Remove Ads popup.
- **Leaf burst:** Starter / Field Pack use `particle_leaf_purple_1` / `2`; Remove Ads uses `particle_leaf_red_1` / `2` (`IapOfferPopup` `leafBurstVariant`).
